#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:92
#: 37afd92c88da44bf91a963099db5e723
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:94
#: d1ba06bd43f244d9b8d1d905156d81f2
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART3 RX input. It supports all "
"RC protocols except PPM. FPort and full duplex protocols will need to use "
"instead,both RX1 and TX1."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认通过 USART3 RX 引脚配置。支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。FPort 和全双工协议需要同时使用 RX1 和 TX1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:96
#: f237e6e4e3e3425aa5b308875c412d5d
msgid ""
"If the receiver is FPort or a full duplex protocol, then the receiver must "
"be tied to the USART1 TX pin and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7"
" (invert TX/RX, half duplex), :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` set "
"to 23, and :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` =3."
msgstr ""
"如果接收机是 FPort 或全双工协议，则接收机必须连接到 USART1 TX 引脚，并设置 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7（TX/RX "
"反转，半双工），:ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 "
"23，:ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:100
#: 197e6f279eea40758c638508a54b77a9
msgid "Dshot Capability"
msgstr "DShot 能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:102
#: ef2f8223219747edb685eb3e9cf598e9
msgid ""
"All motor 1-4 outputs are bi-directional Dshot and PWM capable. However, "
"mixing Dshot and normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups,"
" ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in "
"that group be configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The "
"output groups that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a"
" normal servo/motor output) are: 1/4, and 2/3."
msgstr ""
"所有 1-4 路电机输出均支持双向 DShot 和 PWM。但在输出组内混合使用 DShot 和普通 PWM 受到限制，即为某一组内的某个输出启用 "
"DShot，需要该组内所有输出均配置为 DShot，而不是 PWM 输出。必须保持相同（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，当配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1/4 和 2/3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-beastf7AIO.rst:105
